{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56499","headline":"法师昇高座时咏 · 朱君绪","name":"法师昇高座时咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"斋直道所务，妙品元始贵。\n故设祖劫桥，广度诸民物。\n尔曰设清斋，帐座罗五色。\n天仙游诞上，五帝列方职。\n功曹传符命，拥卫左右直。\n我昇龙舆座。\n玉梯附机息。\n神霄助授护，天魔不举目。\n五神不移动，披宣太上域。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱君绪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56499.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56499","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}